    "summary": "In either player's Fight phase, once an enemy unit picks its targets, spend 1 CP on one ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit of yours it aimed at least one attack at. While the phase lasts, whenever a model in that unit is destroyed before it has fought this phase, roll a D6, adding 2 for a CHARACTER model. On 4+, leave it in play: once the attacking unit is done with its attacks, the model can fight as if it had 1 wound left, and after that it is removed.",
